OL,3,GNEWSAThe pumpkin 'obsession' behind
OL,4,ARocky and Big Boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost vegetable patch enthusiasts dream
OL,7,Fof successfully growing a perfect
OL,8,Fpumpkin to place on their front step,
OL,9,Fadorned with a scary face, ready for
OL,10,Ftrick or treaters in October.
OL,12,FGlyn Beasley takes things a little more
OL,13,Fseriously.
OL,15,FBack when he was a boy, he proudly took
OL,16,Fa 40lb (18kg) pumpkin to a competition
OL,17,Frun by his dad, sparking his obsession
OL,18,Fwith the orange fruit.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
