OL,3,GNEWSAThe pumpkin 'obsession' behind
OL,4,ARocky and Big Boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FEver since the contest, the
OL,7,F55-year-old, from Coalville in
OL,8,FLeicestershire, has been trying to beat
OL,9,Fhis weight record. This year, he has
OL,10,Fmore than doubled his record - twice.
